learn.description:
Current learning session: {status}

Pick a device and duration, choose Start, then operate the feature in the official App. A session lasts at most 600 seconds and ends by itself — stopping it here is optional.

Stopping writes no files: go back to the menu and choose "2. Generate a draft". No command is ever sent to the device while learning.

draft_confirm.description:
Written: {file}
{note}

{controls}

"Allow unverified controls" is off: the learned buttons will not appear. Tick the option below to enable it and reload now; it also affects unverified controls of other devices.

draft_confirm_enabled.description:
Written: {file}
{note}

{controls}

"Allow unverified controls" is already on: the learned buttons work after a reload.

cleanup.description:
Generated draft files: {drafts}

A learning session also leaves a fixture and an export bundle:
- fixtures directory: {fixtures}
- exports directory: {exports}

Tick what should be deleted; anything left unticked stays. Hand-written profiles are never touched.
